      "root_cause": "Client table `sentinel-features-1.0.0` froze `mcc_target_encoded_rate` at `mcc_encoding_as_of = 2024-11-30T18:30:00+00:00` (30 days after `2024-11-01` start). Because chargeback labels require 60 days to mature (`label_available_at = transaction_time + 60d`), exactly 0 labels were mature at `2024-11-30`, so the client encoder emitted its m=100 prior (`0.012` for high-risk MCCs, `0.004` for standard MCCs). Dynamic point-in-time Bayesian smoothing `(fraud_count + 0.6) / (total_count + 100)` begins updating only after `2024-12-31` when warmup labels mature, preventing 60-day look-ahead label leakage."
